   290	            direction: .event, payload: turnPayload, runID: runID,
   291	            sentAt: now, seq: seq, sessionID: ourSessionID, ts: now, type: .evtTurnComplete
   292	        ))
   293	    }
   294	
   295	    // aborted == true -> operationCompleted。outcome 判别：真实样本里 phase=="end" 时
   296	    // status=="cancelled"（sessions.abort 的 RPC 结果本身也确认了 outcome:"aborted"）记
   297	    // succeeded（"这次 abort 操作成功执行了"，不是"这次 run 成功完成"——两者是不同维度）；
   298	    // phase=="error" 那条后续帧语义不够确定（可能是 abort 生效后的收尾错误，也可能是别的失败），
   299	    // 保守记 abortedEffectUnknown，不假装知道更多。
   300	    let outcome: PayloadOutcome = phase == "end" ? .succeeded : .abortedEffectUnknown
   301	    let operationID = "\(ourSessionID)-abort-\(runID)"
   302	    let detail = jsonString(data["error"])
   303	    let opPayload = OperationCompletedEventMessagePayload(
   304	        affectedRunID: runID, detail: detail, newRunID: nil,
   305	        operationID: operationID, operationKind: .stop, outcome: outcome
   306	    )
   307	    return .operationCompleted(OperationCompletedEventMessage(
   308	        direction: .event, payload: opPayload, runID: runID,
   309	        sentAt: now, seq: seq, sessionID: ourSessionID, ts: now, type: .evtOperationCompleted
   310	    ))
   311	}
